Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Describes vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le14ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class =\"strong\"> Suggestions in Advertising</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you read an advertisement, you see phrases that make suggestions. They can influence your decision."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Why not see one of the seven Natural Wonders of the World?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">What it Says in the Ad</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Come to the Grand Canyon to get away from the stress of everyday life. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's an appealing invitation.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sleep in the open air.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's a unique experience.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Climb with us to see a panorama.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> It's an invitation to excitement. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why not follow the Bright Angel Trail?  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There are no negative reasons. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hiking boots are important.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You shouldn't use other shoes. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">A fleece jacket is a must. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You could be cold if you don't bring one.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">A water bottle is essential. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You can't survive without it.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Sunscreen lotion is essential.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">essential</span> "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very much needed  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Water is essential when we go for a long hike."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear when you prepare for a hiking trip."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">angel</span> "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a heavenly being "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When I was tired, I felt like an angel helped me up the mountain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">everyday</span> "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "ordinary; typical; usual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sitting on a crowded bus is an everyday routine for me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">the wild</span>"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the outdoors in its natural form "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Camping in the wild is quite different from camping at the beach."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">important</span> "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes something with great value "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's very important to have a cellphone when you go out of the city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">campground</span> "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small area used for camping "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: After we arrived at the campground, we put up our tent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find an ad in the newspaper or on a website for a trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find what the ad says you can do on this trip. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Chat with your friends about what you can do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 sentences about the items you need to bring on this trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your friends to write another list. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Decide together what you should bring."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I locate information on an advertisement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express and receive suggestions using the target words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 5-7 sentences about items necessary for a trip."}]}], "type": "sena"}